UNDS IN THE AMOUNT OF $55,000 TO THE PROJECT.   THIS FUNDING IS FOR HALVIK TO MAKE ENHANCEMENTS TO THE COMPUTERIZED TRACKING&MONITORING SYSTEM (CTMS) AS DESCRIBED IN THE ATTACHED REQUESTS FOR CHANGE (SEE ATTACHED, CTMS-RFC-001, 002 AND 003).  THIS IS A TIME AND MATERIALS TASK ORDER AND C-70/C-75 WILL DIRECT THE CONTRACTOR AS TO WHICH OF THE DEVELOPMENT-RELATED TASKS AS DESCRIBED IN THE ATTACHED RFCS WILL BE PERFORMED ON THE CTMS DATABASE.   THE COST OF THE WORK IS NOT TO EXCEED THE OBLIGATED $55,000.  THE PERIOD OF PERFORMANCE IS FROM JUNE 25, 2018 THROUGH DECEMBER 30, 2018.      THE FY18 FUNDING AMOUNT OF $55,000 IS NOT SUBJECT TO THE AVAILABILITY OF FUNDS AND SO IS FULLY AVAILABLE FOR OBLIGATION NOW, NOTWITHSTANDING THE APPLICABILITY OF ANY OTHER BUDGETARY CONSTRAINTS.   THE PERIOD OF PERFORMANCE FOR THIS TASK ORDER IS FROM 6/25/18 TO 12/30/18.","generated_unique_award_id":null,"Awarding Agency":"Department of Transportation","awarding_agency_id":731,"agency_slug":"department-of-transportation","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_693JK418F960069_6901_DTOS5917D00504_6901"},{"internal_id":298268545,"Award ID":"FA521520F0024","Award Amount":88463.0,"Description":"APCSS GARTNER MEMBERSHIP","generated_unique_award_id":null,"Awarding Agency":"Department of Defense","awarding_agency_id":1173,"agency_slug":"department-of-defense","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_FA521520F0024_9700_N6600119A0049_9700"},{"internal_id":343535792,"Award ID":"TDO17F102","Award Amount":88513.0,"Description":"IGF::OT::IGF SUBSCRIPTION SERVICES","generated_unique_award_id":null,"Awarding Agency":"Department of the Treasury","awarding_agency_id":456,"agency_slug":"department-of-the-treasury","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_TDO17F102_2001_-NONE-_-NONE-"},{"internal_id":309179245,"Award ID":"M0026418F0436","Award Amount":88593.67,"Description":"NATIONWIDE WIRELESS SERVICE CONTRACT","generated_unique_award_id":null,"Awarding Agency":"Department of Defense","awarding_agency_id":1173,"agency_slug":"de